      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{66da4f0ce6fca549a7488a7e|full_name} I agree yeah, there's sometimes information that needs to be shown, and it's good to know that you can grab an object, but it should be able to just have the text there since the text also denotes that, yes, there's an object there that you can interact with, while also giving you no distractions otherwise.",
